WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.845
Hi, friends.

00:00:04.845 --> 00:00:08.536
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:08.536 --> 00:00:11.612
Hands flat on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:11.612 --> 00:00:14.073
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:14.073 --> 00:00:16.533
This is Kind Words to Myself.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:22.685
The voice inside your head talks to you all day. It can learn to talk like a friend.

00:00:22.685 --> 00:00:27.606
I'll say three kind sentences, slowly. You can say them with me — out loud, or just inside.

00:00:27.606 --> 00:00:39.908
First one. "I can take my time." … Say it with me: "I can take my time."

00:00:39.908 --> 00:00:52.211
Second one. "Mistakes help me learn." … Say it with me: "Mistakes help me learn."

00:00:52.211 --> 00:01:02.054
Third one. "I am learning, and that is enough." … Say it with me: "I am learning, and that is enough."

00:01:02.054 --> 00:01:09.435
Those words are yours now. You can use them any time — before a test, after a hard moment, whenever you need a friend inside.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:11.896
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:01:11.896 --> 00:01:15.587
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:01:15.587 --> 00:01:19.278
You're ready for what's next.
